></a></li><li class="" data-position="153" data-id="861418"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861418/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 153 My Sweetheart’s Kind</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="154" data-id="861419"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861419/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 154 Darling, It’s Normal</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="155" data-id="861420"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861420/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 155 A Full House (Cat &#038; Dog)</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="156" data-id="861421"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861421/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 156 She’s Just Toying With Him!</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="157" data-id="861422"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861422/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 157 You’re Free</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="158" data-id="861423"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861423/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 158 A Stranger’s Blessing?</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="159" data-id="861424"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861424/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 159 Doomed to Miss Each Other</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="160" data-id="861425"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861425/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 160 You Know Me Well?</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="161" data-id="861426"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861426/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 161 Don’t You Want to Marry Your Fiancée?</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="162" data-id="861427"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861427/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 162 Darling? Say It Again</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="163" data-id="861428"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861428/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 163 You Called Me Mom</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="164" data-id="861429"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861429/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 164 Be Good, I’m Working</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="165" data-id="861430"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861430/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 165 No Wonder You’re So Pathetic</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="166" data-id="861431"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861431/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 166 Maybe This Brother-in-Law’s Not So Bad?</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="167" data-id="861432"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861432/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 167 Brother-in-Law</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="168" data-id="861433"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861433/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 168 Brother-in-Law, You’re Fighting Dirty!</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="169" data-id="861434"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861434/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 169 Just Sleep or Sleep Chaste?</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="170" data-id="861435"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861435/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 170 Instant Agreement</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="171" data-id="861436"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861436/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 171 Wife’s Surprise Ruined</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="172" data-id="861437"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861437/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 172 No Younger Brother</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="173" data-id="861438"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861438/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 173 This Life Is What He Deserves</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="174" data-id="861439"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861439/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 174 Secrets and Martial Spats</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="175" data-id="861440"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861440/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 175 Bro, Why So Gloomy?</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="176" data-id="861441"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861441/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 176 We Can’t Be Friends</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="177" data-id="861442"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861442/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 177 Domestic Violence Isn’t a Good Habit</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="178" data-id="861443"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861443/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 178 Fight at Home</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="179" data-id="861444"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861444/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 179 Rather Kill Him Than Let Qin Shuyi Be With Another</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="180" data-id="861445"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861445/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 180 Shameless Homewrecker!</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="181" data-id="861446"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861446/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 181 Steps to Reconciliation</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="182" data-id="861447"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861447/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 182 His Wife Left Him</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="183" data-id="861448"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861448/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 183 You Yelled at Me</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="184" data-id="861449"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861449/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 184 Ling Jue, You Perv</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="185" data-id="861450"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861450/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 185 Whoever Kisses First Is a Dog</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="186" data-id="861451"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861451/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 186 Darling’s Jealous</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="187" data-id="861452"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861452/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 187 Darling, Let’s Go Home</span></a></li><li class="" data-position="188" data-id="861453"><a href="https://www.asianovel.net/chapter/chapter-861453/"><i class='fa-solid fa-book'></i><span class="truncate _1-1">Chapter 188 Secret Affair</span></a></li><li class="" data-positio